      "trigger": "A required status, boundary, provenance, or base-status file contains valid non-object JSON such as null or [].",
      "execution_path": "completion_gate._read parses the value and returns None without adding a reason. Each subsequent record check runs only when its value is not None, so the required check is skipped.",
